cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Music Never Stopped: A Grateful Data Compendium with Category-Theoretic Interpretation"
abstract: >
  A modular, citation-bound Grateful Dead data compendium integrating shows,
  songs, performances, personnel, venues, recordings, and reception across
  Setlist.fm, the Setlist Program, the CMU/Leone setlist archive, GDsets,
  gdshowsdb, the Internet Archive Live Music Archive, the Alex Allan lyric
  finder, the official band site, and reference sources (Wikipedia,
  Britannica, Dodd's annotated lyrics). Pairs the compendium with a
  category-theoretic interpretation in which performances are spans and
  setlists/lineups arise as functors from a time category.
authors:
